<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">25042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Brent crude has reached one hundred and six dollars a barrel as Iran's closure of the Strait of Hormuz enters its second month — the largest oil supply disruption in history.</s> <s>Iran's foreign minister Araghchi has arrived in Islamabad for a second round of talks with Washington, the only venue both sides accept.</s> <s>Tehran demands the war premium lift before any progress... and the war premium is no longer a spike, it's the new floor.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>United States forces killed two more people on a vessel in the eastern Pacific, the latest in a campaign that has now killed more than one hundred and seventy since September.</s> <s>No one's been charged, no court has accepted jurisdiction, and Congress has held no authorization vote.</s> <s>Extrajudicial killing has quietly become routine military doctrine in Latin American waters, with no accountability mechanism in sight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mexican prosecutors charged Rosalinda González Valencia, known as La Jefa, with laundering one hundred and sixty-five million dollars through seventy-three front companies.</s> <s>She built the financial machine of the country's most powerful cartel while US sanctions chased gunmen rather than the women who actually move the money.</s> <s>Her husband El Mencho is dead... and her son Juan Carlos is now competing for the throne.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sudan sent a delegation to the IMF spring meetings in Washington, but US sanctions blocked the finance minister himself from attending.</s> <s>The two thousand twenty-one coup that General Burhan led with Hemedti froze one point eight billion dollars in World Bank grants, and Khartoum has neither territorial control nor a reform record to unlock them.</s> <s>The Fund has set no timeline for restoring Sudan's access to concessional financing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A leaked Pentagon email has threatened Spain's <sub alias="NATO">NATO</sub> membership over its refusal to provide bases and airspace for the Iran war.</s> <s>The alliance's founding treaty contains no suspension provision, and Washington has no treaty power to expel a member for blocking a coalition operation.</s> <s>European leaders are now staging a May simulation of Article forty-two point seven — the union's own mutual defence clause.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's Federal Security Service says it foiled a car-bomb plot against the leadership of Roskomnadzor, the country's internet censor, detaining seven suspects.</s> <s>The agency claims Ukraine recruited the cell through Telegram, charging them under terrorism statutes that carry life imprisonment.</s> <s>Targeting the censor rather than a military commander signals a widening of what both sides treat as legitimate wartime infrastructure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The UN Mine Action Service says clearing unexploded ordnance from Gaza will cost five hundred and forty-one million dollars, with debris surfacing every six hundred metres.</s> <s>That ordnance has killed more than a thousand people since the conflict began, most of them children, and it's blocking reconstruction across the entire territory.</s> <s>The bombing has stopped... the killing hasn't.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Eleven Pakistani sailors have been taken hostage off the coast of Somalia after pirates seized their tanker in the Gulf of Aden.</s> <s>Somali piracy resurges whenever anti-piracy naval cover thins, and Iran-theatre deployments have drawn warships away from that corridor.</s> <s>Pakistan's maritime affairs ministry has ordered an inquiry, but no rescue operation's been mounted.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt's draft budget shifts fuel subsidies away from households and toward export firms, even as interest payments consume nearly half of all government spending.</s> <s>Finance ministry data show health spending at one point seven two percent of <sub alias="G D P">GDP</sub>, against a constitutionally mandated floor of six percent.</s> <s>The fiscal gap is widening, and parliament must now decide who absorbs the squeeze.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Reserve Bank has killed Paytm's banking license after eight years of escalating enforcement over know-your-customer violations and related-party flows.</s> <s>The central bank is seeking a High Court winding-up order, though Paytm holds enough capital to repay all depositors.</s> <s>The case marks the first time India has dissolved a digital-first payments bank — a warning shot to the entire fintech sector.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>British researchers have identified the protein switch that lets lung cancer evade Sotorasib, one of the leading targeted therapies on the market.</s> <s>Aurora kinase A stabilises a protein called Prohibitin two, opening a bypass around the cancer gene the drug was designed to block.</s> <s>Adding an Aurora kinase inhibitor restored sensitivity in animal models, and human trials are now pending.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The World Meteorological Organization warns El Niño may arrive by May, with equatorial Pacific temperatures climbing faster than forecasters expected.</s> <s>The pattern typically cuts monsoon rainfall across South Asia and collapses Sahel harvests in a single season.</s> <s>India and Pakistan open kharif planting in June... and tens of millions of farmers will be planting into a climate that hasn't yet declared itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In southern Lebanon, only eight of one hundred and twenty hives at the ByBee apiary survived Israeli strikes, gutting the region's pollinator base.</s> <s>The country's bee population had already fallen sixty percent over two decades from pesticides, and war damage takes years to recover from.</s> <s>The two thousand twenty-six citrus and olive harvest in the Litani basin will quietly fail — damage that outlasts the bombing and stays uncounted.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China's DeepSeek released its V four model on Friday, a one point six trillion parameter system the company says matches leading American closed models on coding benchmarks.</s> <s>It's open-source, cheaper to run, and was trained on both Nvidia and Huawei Ascend chips — undercutting the premise that US export controls have contained Chinese frontier capability.</s> <s>The race for AI supremacy now has a credible second runner... on the wrong side of the chip embargo.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>